# HAT TRICK, 3-10: the Lifeguard and his Chair. The Lifeguard (a big polo
# player) swims about throwing rings and takes many hits; beaten, he bursts
# into five drumsticks but the match goes on: he is back from the changing
# hut a few seconds later. The Chair only hops about, and it is the one that
# matters: knock it down and the Lifeguard goes with it. The top lane rope
# carries our own message in Morse. The demo player beats them.
game hattrick
wait 5
cheat level 30
cheat skipintro
cheat god
expect foes_14 == 1
expect foes_15 == 1
expect hp_14 == 40
expect hp_15 == 10
expect morse_ok == 1
waituntil shots_6 >= 2 300
# the Lifeguard beaten: food, but he comes back
cheat noshots
cheat still
cheat bosspos 200 140
cheat foehp 14 1
cheat pos 0 120 160
cheat carry 0
wait 2
hold DOWN
press B 1
release
waituntil away_14 == 1 60
expect foes == 2
expect falling == 5
cheat unstill
wait 320
expect away_14 == 0
expect hp_14 == 40
# the Chair down: both gone
cheat still
cheat noshots
cheat foehp 15 1
cheat foehp 14 40
wait 1
cheat mortal
cheat spare 0 99
cheat unstill
botuntil foes == 0 9000
expect foes_14 == 0
expect foes_15 == 0
expect sub == 2
# and the whole fight from the start, at full strength
cheat level 30
cheat skipintro
cheat spare 0 99
botuntil sub >= 2 12000
expect foes == 0
